# the user bank uploaded as from USB: the SysEx frames tools/loom_samples.py would send (build/gen/user_bank.syx, made
# by tests/run_tests.sh: "syx"), each through samples.c (BEGIN, the pages, the header's parts, END: its CRC checked);
# then the bank as the same tool's image would leave it ("samples"), the same; then an upload over it, and the first
# sample, at 16 kHz, on track 3's sample engine at its own pitch
expect user 0
upload build/gen/user_bank.syx
expect user 2
expect rate1 16000
expect rate2 22050
expect rate3 0
readback build/gen/user_bank.bin
samples build/gen/user_bank.bin
expect user 2
expect rate1 16000
upload build/gen/user_bank.syx
expect user 2
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
tap EDIT
param 3 0 6
param 3 1 8
param 3 4 0
expect par3.1 8
wait 60
shot upload_user1.png
wav upload_user1.wav
tapkey w0
wait 400
wavstop
